---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Privacy policy"
    description="Privacy policy for Kyle Avrett website."
>
    <article class="space-y-6">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Privacy policy</h1>
        <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 7, 2026</p>

        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">What this site collects</h2>
            <p>
                This site does not ask you to create an account, does not run a
                newsletter signup, and does not sell personal information.
            </p>
            <p>
                If you email Kyle Avrett, your message includes the information
                you choose to send, such as your email address and message text.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Hosting and logs</h2>
            <p>
                The site may be hosted by Cloudflare. Cloudflare may process
                request data such as IP address, user agent, referring page,
                requested URL, and request time to deliver the site, protect it,
                and keep logs.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Cookies and analytics</h2>
            <p>
                This site does not set tracking cookies or run third-party
                analytics in its own code.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">External links</h2>
            <p>
                Links to GitHub, LinkedIn, X, RSS readers, and other sites are
                handled by those services. Their privacy policies apply when you
                visit them.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Contact</h2>
            <p>
                Questions about this policy can be sent to
                <a href="mailto:kyle@kyleavrett.com">kyle@kyleavrett.com</a>.
            </p>
        </section>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>
